{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18700","headline":"巽公院五咏 苦竹桥 · 柳宗元","name":"巽公院五咏 苦竹桥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"危桥属幽径，缭绕穿疎林。\n迸箨分苦节，轻筠抱虚心。\n俯瞰涓涓流，仰聆萧萧吟。\n差池下烟日，嘲异常鸣山禽。\n谅无要津用，栖息有余阴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18700.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18700","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}